## 二、系统依赖安装

### 2.1 Ubuntu / Debian

```bash
# 基础编译工具
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y build-essential cmake g++ git pkg-config

# 数据库
sudo apt install -y mysql-server libmysqlclient-dev

# 加密与 JWT
sudo apt install -y libssl-dev libjwt-dev

# Protobuf
sudo apt install -y libprotobuf-dev protobuf-compiler

# 压缩库
sudo apt install -y liblz4-dev libsnappy-dev

# HTTP 传输 (OSS SDK 依赖)
sudo apt install -y libcurl4-openssl-dev

# 消息队列服务
sudo apt install -y rabbitmq-server

# 工具
sudo apt install -y nlohmann-json3-dev   # 若无则从 GitHub 下载 header-only
```

### 2.2 CentOS / Rocky Linux

```bash
# 基础编译工具
sudo dnf groupinstall -y "Development Tools"
sudo dnf install -y cmake gcc-c++ git pkgconfig

# 数据库
sudo dnf install -y mysql-server mysql-devel

# 加密与 JWT
sudo dnf install -y openssl-devel libjwt-devel

# Protobuf
sudo dnf install -y protobuf-devel protobuf-compiler

# 压缩库
sudo dnf install -y lz4-devel snappy-devel

# HTTP 传输
sudo dnf install -y libcurl-devel

# 消息队列
sudo dnf install -y rabbitmq-server
```

### 2.3 macOS (Homebrew)

```bash
brew install cmake mysql protobuf openssl jwt-cpp lz4 snappy curl rabbitmq nlohmann-json
```

